        {
          "index": 1,
          "type": "input",
          "title": "You'll want to know: поступление",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "поступление (postupléniye) — \"admission (to a university); entry\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Поступление в университет — важный шаг. Postupléniye v universitét — vázhnyy shag. Getting into university is an important step."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Neuter. From поступать, to enter a university. It also means money coming in: поступление (postupléniye) денег."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "поступление (postupléniye) is built on поступить \"to enter\", from по- and ступить \"to step\", an inherited Slavic verb: the step into a university."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "type": "notice",
          "title": "What you've built",
          "segments": [
            {
