            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Абитуриенты сдают экзамены летом. Abituriyénty sdayút ekzámeny létom. University applicants sit their exams in the summer."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Masculine. Someone applying to a university; in German the same word means a school leaver."
            }
